WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.065 --> 00:00:02.565
My name's Scott Allen and I own the Business Next Door,

2
00:00:02.565 --> 00:00:03.725
Allen Landscape Center.

3
00:00:04.505 --> 00:00:05.885
And I've been there for 40 years.

4
00:00:06.525 --> 00:00:09.005
I also associated with Pepe's Restaurant

5
00:00:09.025 --> 00:00:11.085
and Javier's been there 27 years.

6
00:00:11.665 --> 00:00:14.085
Javier runs the cleanest restaurant I've ever seen.

7
00:00:14.425 --> 00:00:15.845
My garden center is spotless

8
00:00:16.225 --> 00:00:19.645
and ever since I got to know Ed, when he came out here four

9
00:00:19.645 --> 00:00:22.285
or five years ago, I watched him take this place.

10
00:00:22.785 --> 00:00:24.085
It was already okay,

11
00:00:24.465 --> 00:00:27.485
but he really made the outside the inside clean

12
00:00:27.505 --> 00:00:29.045
and put all the right stuff in here.

13
00:00:29.065 --> 00:00:31.045
And he is very particular in

14
00:00:31.305 --> 00:00:33.285
how the place looks and how clean it is.

15
00:00:33.585 --> 00:00:34.645
And that carries over.

16
00:00:34.785 --> 00:00:36.685
And I know this from personal experience

17
00:00:37.365 --> 00:00:39.125
'cause I've had their company Ed

18
00:00:39.145 --> 00:00:42.485
and the Phil Collision work on several of my vehicles

19
00:00:42.545 --> 00:00:45.925
and I've recommended him to other people that come in.

20
00:00:46.225 --> 00:00:48.205
And everyone's been totally satisfied.

21
00:00:48.575 --> 00:00:51.805
There hasn't been a problem with what the work he's done

22
00:00:51.805 --> 00:00:54.925
for me, but if there ever was a problem, all you have

23
00:00:54.925 --> 00:00:57.765
to do is call him back up and he would straighten it out.

24
00:00:57.865 --> 00:01:00.525
So I've been blessed to have a clean place

25
00:01:00.525 --> 00:01:02.005
that I keep cleanest.

26
00:01:02.005 --> 00:01:04.765
Garden Center around Pepe runs the cleanest restaurant

27
00:01:05.065 --> 00:01:08.805
and this guy has matched us in the way he runs his business

28
00:01:08.805 --> 00:01:10.765
in the cleanliness and the finished product.

29
00:01:10.785 --> 00:01:13.285
If you'll be very happy if you hired him to do your work

30
00:01:14.025 --> 00:01:16.125
and if you don't aren't happy, come see me

31
00:01:16.185 --> 00:01:17.365
and I'll give it a call.
